// The notification bus.
//
// Everything that wants to reach the phone commands this one item, and
// rules/notifications.rules is the only place that knows how a push is sent.
// HomeController holds the alarm table (app.alarmJobs in application.yaml) and
// talks only to openHAB items, so this is how it notifies; a rule that wants to
// notify does the same rather than calling the cloud action itself.
//
// Payload is SEVERITY|id|text:
//   ALARM|fence-upper-low|Horní ohradník má jen 4200 V
//   INFO|window-open-cold|Otevřené okno, venku 3 °C
//   CLEAR|fence-upper-low|              withdraws that notification again
//
// The id travels as the notification's reference id, which is what lets a
// notification be taken off the phone once the fault is over instead of
// sitting in the list looking current.
String notify_message "Notifikace [%s]" <text>
